  (text "FLEX: open-collector signal, 4.7k pull-up to 5V, 10k + BAT54S clamp to 3V3 into GPIO3. Sensor 12V via F2 PTC."
    (at 93.98 180.34 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "32bdfa20-4e21-404e-a544-34c95e467469")
  )
  (text "ANALOG 0-5V: 12k/20k divider (x0.625, firmware ANALOG_SCALE=1.6), 100nF, BAT54S clamp -> ADS1115 @0x48. GND_SENS joins GND only at NT1 (star point near ADC)."
    (at 35.56 297.18 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a3c44935-81f0-448f-8c8f-84e50f7fabd8")
  )
  (text "CAN: TJA1051T/3. S pulled high = silent until firmware drives GPIO21 low.\nJP1 bridges 120R termination (default open)."
    (at 391.16 111.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "627961cb-d465-4c3c-b064-bea6cb8fcbb6")
  )
  (text "OUTPUTS: BTS3256D HITFET, 7.5A nom, 12kHz max PWM, internal 40V active clamp.\n3.3k series (fault readback), 100k pulldown holds OFF in reset. SRP open = fast slew; fit R38-41 to slow edges.\nLoad current returns via J1 pins 2+24."
    (at 276.86 292.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e522771a-504b-424e-96b5-74632e67e937")
  )
